content-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHP-c4eoZANyq6rXCT1oIWVjStWXp9SW9eGnhBPs4XTLQ&oe=6A8070D7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Behind You", "keywords": ["Horror", "spy", "escape", "fun", "chaotic"], "long_description": "Behind You\n\nMultiplayer VR Spy Horror Hide & Seek\n\nStep into the shadows in Behind You, a chaotic multiplayer VR hide-and-seek game where survival is never guaranteed.\n\nYou and your friends are covert spies trapped inside eerie, high-security locations. To escape, you\u2019ll need to search for tools, unlock doors, and outsmart the enemy before it\u2019s too late. But there\u2019s a catch\u2014one of you isn\u2019t who they seem.\n\nEach round, one player becomes the Seeker, a terrifying hunter with enhanced senses, while the rest must work together to stay hidden, complete objectives, and make a daring escape. With 2\u201310 player lobbies, every match is unpredictable, scary, and ridiculously fun.\n\n\ud83d\udd11 Features\n\nMultiplayer VR Chaos \u2013 Proximity voice chat means whispers, screams, and laughter echo through every match.\n\nSpy-Themed Escape Gameplay \u2013 Search for tools, hack systems, and unlock exits while avoiding the Seeker.\n\nBe the Monster \u2013 Hunt down your friends with terrifying abilities.\n\nDynamic Maps \u2013 Creepy warehouses, abandoned mansions, and secret labs to explore and survive.\n\nSocial Waiting Room \u2013 Hang out in the underground Safehouse lobby before missions, plan your escape, or just mess around.", "short_description": "Behind You is a multiplayer VR hide-and-seek horror game for 2\u201310 players. Work together as spies to find tools, unlock exits, and escape\u2014while one player becomes the terrifying Seeker hunting you down. Proximity voice chat, chaotic gameplay, and jump scares make every match unpredictable."}]}, "developer_name": "BmixMan", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/gystudiosprivacypolicy/ho